+
+`shared/spellCatalog.js` contains user-designed source records rather than generated official tables. An enabled GameData overlays them; the client resolves those IDs from the same module. They are excluded from native random equipment pools. Art is downloaded separately with `node tools/fetch-spell-assets.mjs` into ignored public/assets/spells. No change to data/items.json or to the installed asset manifest is required.
+
+The source integration copies independent hero JSON to mods/hero-strategies/bands.json and regenerates shared/heroCatalog.js using tools/sync-tavern-heroes.mjs. It does not edit generated data/*.json. Match-owned data overlays are conditional on heroMod; the client catalog permits details while draft flags govern availability.
